0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(markers, telic aspectual affixes, and spatial postpositions. Drawing on) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(connected texts spanning a century of documentation, we demonstrate that) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(motion verbs specifying vertical axis \(ascent/descent\) and deictic) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(orientation \(centrifugal vs centripetal\) systematically fuse with verbal) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(stems to form complex path predicates.) Tj
